ations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Download the free desktop release or server from an official source and pin the version.","Use a small custom map with fixed starting resources and wave settings.","For source changes, follow the repository JDK/Gradle requirements rather than assuming a preinstalled Java version.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Build a production chain that sustains a specified resource rate before a fixed wave.","Change a block or unit rule and verify loading, construction and client/server behavior.","Measure resource waste, survival and goal completion on a fixed custom map.","AI use and evaluation boundary","A useful source-accessible test bed for planning and code changes. Retain license records for extracted assets, maps and plugins rather than inferring unrestricted dataset use from the free download.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Repository license","https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry/blob/master/LICENSE","Official source, server and build guidance","https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry","Author download and pricing","https://anuke.itch.io/mindustry","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":94},"Terms category","Mixed code / asset licenses","terms","provenance","Asset license","Check repository and bundled third-party notices for the selected release; no blanket CC0 asset grant is asserted here.","assetLicense","Code license","GPLv3; retain notices for dependencies and distributed modifications.","codeLicense","Get started",[116],"access",{"_54":117,"_25":98,"_118":119},"Free author download","note","The author itch.io page permits a zero-price download. The Steam edition is paid; free source access does not mean every storefront release is free.","Primary source",[123],"sourceUrl",{"_54":120,"_25":96},"Stack","Java / Gradle / factory and tower defense","stack","Tracks",[130],"